# Real shared admission refuses a third provider call. All transport is intercepted.
name: Study report preserves partial coverage, context, source and accounting through restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_limit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 context-draft | context-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | context-result
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | generated-map
keys: u
require-live-snap: 20 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
require-live-snap: 20 TOOLS | scanner
submit: options sast:scan
require-live-snap: 20 sast:scan | scanner-options
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks agentic
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | inherited-form
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
keys: L
wait-for: 30 Draft ready
require-live-snap: 30 Enter edit · L next | scan-draft
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_limit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | limited-approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last
expect: Total provider calls: 5
expect: Protected review calls: 2
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: Calls already committed: 1
expect: 2 context/scan calls · 2 protected review calls
ask: Does approval disclose this exact finite work and allowance before execution, including that existing commitments are retained?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-scan
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_limit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | jobs-before-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | dispatcher-started
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_limit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stopped
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 completed 2 / planned 3 | stopped-study
expect: failed 1
expect-not: completed 3 / planned 3
ask: Does the stopped study preserve two completed passes and a failed third attempt without claiming complete coverage or a zero dollar charge?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | retained-allowance
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 3 committed / 5 total | protected-review
expect: 0 context/scan · 2 protected review
ask: Are the two protected review calls still available while discovery is exhausted, with no silent allowance increase?
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | partial-scan
expect: RESULT partial
expect: partial
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_limit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unselected
ask: Does partial Scan remain unaccepted until the operator explicitly acknowledges its incomplete work?
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 15 u Acknowledge & use partial | partial-scan-navigation
ask: Is partial acceptance available through the displayed keyboard control while the result still discloses incomplete work?
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | acknowledged-scan
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_limit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART selected
expect: 1 remaining
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 Esc nav findings | review-prompt
paste-file: @ART/open-recurring.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 needs_review | recurring-review
submit: dismiss false_positive Labeled synthetic limit observation
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | reviewed-observation
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope: study | report-ready
expect: Work: 2 completed / 3 planned
expect: 3 committed / 5 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
expect-not: $0.0000
keys: s
require-live-snap: 20 Scope: workspace history | workspace-history
ask: Does workspace history clearly disclose that it includes all recorded source revisions and makes no study coverage claim?
keys: s
require-live-snap: 20 Scope: study | selected-study
expect: 1 findings · 1 reviewed
expect-not: REVIEW VIEW
ask: Can the operator finish and report retained findings after the allowance stop, without starting more discovery?
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 EXPORTED | exported-report
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART formats
keys: p End
require-live-snap: 20 p provenance | report-provenance-tail
ask: Are coverage limits, frozen provenance and report controls readable, with no suggestion that missing observations establish fixes?
resize: 160x48
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 ── REPORT ─ | report-160x48-top
expect-not: $0.00 spent
expect-not: budget not enforced
ask: At 160x48, is the report's state readable and its paging or next action discoverable?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 provenance | report-160x48-tail
ask: At 160x48, can the operator reach the complete tail and return without losing report selection or destination?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 ── REPORT ─ | report-120x36-top
ask: At 120x36, is the report's state readable and its paging or next action discoverable?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 provenance | report-120x36-tail
ask: At 120x36, can the operator reach the complete tail and return without losing report selection or destination?
resize: 96x89
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 ── REPORT ─ | report-96x89-top
ask: At 96x89, is the report's state readable and its paging or next action discoverable?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 provenance | report-96x89-tail
ask: At 96x89, can the operator reach the complete tail and return without losing report selection or destination?
resize: 80x24
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 ── REPORT ─ | report-80x24-top
ask: At 80x24, is the report's state readable and its paging or next action discoverable?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 provenance | report-80x24-tail
ask: At 80x24, can the operator reach the complete tail and return without losing report selection or destination?
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 ── REPORT ─ | report-60x20-top
ask: At 60x20, is the report's state readable and its paging or next action discoverable?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 provenance | report-60x20-tail
ask: At 60x20, can the operator reach the complete tail and return without losing report selection or destination?
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 ── REPORT ─ | report-40x12-top
ask: At 40x12, is the report's state readable and its paging or next action discoverable?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 provenance | report-40x12-tail
ask: At 40x12, can the operator reach the complete tail and return without losing report selection or destination?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home p
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study | restored-report-direct
expect: Work: 2 completed / 3 planned
expect: 3 committed / 5 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
expect: 1 findings · 1 reviewed
expect-not: $0.0000
ask: Does opening Report directly after restart recover the same study, context and shared accounting without launching more work?
keys: j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 30 EXPORTED | restored-export
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
